abstract: "Python workflows for Pacific Arctic gray whale connectivity, including least-cost corridors, seasonal and parameter sensitivities, observation comparisons, and figures and tables. Analyses use documented archived or external inputs. Validation scope, input requirements and AI assistance are documented. MIT covers original project software, not third-party libraries or data."
